:: Ben Ask About Classmate Lucas [nobr]

<<set $Minutes += 1>>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Ben",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<<if !$CompletedQuests.includes("Ben: Track Meet Cute")>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> about his opinions on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> and the boy jumps as if you had just scared him. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“L- L- <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas Taylor</span>!? Wh- why are you asking me about him? I don’t know anything about- I mean, he’s fine but I-”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> freezes for a moment like deer in the headlights before running off. <span style="color:Yellow">That was a… strange reaction.</span>
<<elseif !$CompletedQuests.includes("Lucas: Punishment Game")>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> about his opinions on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> and the boy freezes like a deer in headlights. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Wh- wh- why are you asking me about him? I- I don’t…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> gulps nervously, looking around, before speaking in a hushed tone. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You- you shouldn’t be asking people about him. What if he finds out? Tr- trust me! It’s best to stay out of his way!”</span>
<<else>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> about his opinions on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> and the boy freezes like a deer in headlights. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Wh- why- why are you asking me about him? He didn’t ask about me, did he!?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> gulps nervously, looking around, before speaking in a hushed tone. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I know he’s your friend and all, but you really need to be careful about him. I’ve heard… well, just be careful. Okay?”</span> You nod, <span style="color:Yellow">seeing that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>’ reputation is as bad as he said.</span>
<</if>><br>
<br>
<<endByLocation>>

