<<if !$CompletedQuests.includes("Ben: Track Meet Cute")>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> about his opinions on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> and jumps at the mere mention of his name. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span>!?”</span> He glances around as if saying his name would make him appear, but sighs once he realizes he is safe. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I- I don’t have any opinions on him. He is just another classmate who I would NEVER talk about behind his back. I gotta go!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> <span style="color:Yellow">quickly rushes away, obviously too nervous to talk about <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> to you.</span>
<<else>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> about his opinions on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> and he blushes. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“He’s… Well, I don’t-”</span> He sighs loudly, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“He’s a jerk and a bully and… don’t tell him I said any of this.”</span> You laugh and promise to keep it a secret. Plus, all those things are pretty obvious. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah, but even though they are, I don’t need to give him more reasons to come after me. He’s always been a bit of a bully, but he gets worse every year. It used to just be little things that I didn’t mind, but-”</span> He shrugs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah. A jerk.”</span>
<</if>><br>
<br>
<<endByLocation>>

